{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Drafting Rust backend helpers with a 64KB stderr tail and child process start logic.\n\nResolving a closure borrow conflict in the line-handling callback.\n\nExtending the parser to return a change flag for progress emission.\n\nImplementing finish to extract the last assistant message and usage from agent_end.\n\nExtending filtering to neutralize markup delimiters.\n\nRefactoring the section struct to drop the stored failed flag and recompute it from found and version fields."}}
